-- 22/11/2026: the PNG and JPG images in assets/projects became WebP (same
-- name, .webp). The Studio content in cms_state still points at the old
-- files, so each path is rewritten here, quotes included, so only exact
-- asset paths match. vercel.json also rewrites the old URLs to the WebP
-- files, so the site works before and after this runs. The revision bump
-- makes an admin tab opened before the migration reload instead of
-- saving the old paths back. On an empty database every line is a no-op.
